  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Government of Mongolia and UNIDO Country Programme for inclusive and sustainable industrial development (2025#2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formulation of Country Programme for Mongolia, based on request from the Permanent Mission to DG and DG&apos;s subsequent reply in May 2024. A shortened formulation period is requested since priority areas have been pre-identified by the GOM. Diagnostic study is not foreseen, but PA requested to bridge contract of NPO and organize stakeholder consultations as well as validation meetings</narrative>
  </description>
